      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 4.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "morning, doctor is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.19,
      "end_seconds": 10.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.98,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "doctor it's difficulty walking it's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.39,
      "end_seconds": 23.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.32,
      "end_seconds": 27.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it it began"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.8,
      "end_seconds": 31.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.44,
      "end_seconds": 36.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Oh, about a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.41,
      "end_seconds": 41.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.69,
      "end_seconds": 57.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.98,
      "end_seconds": 76.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, heart rate 85, temperature is 37.0 degrees, BP is 128 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.97,
      "end_seconds": 78.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.18,
      "end_seconds": 84.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "They help me see the the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.89,
      "end_seconds": 91.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.36,
      "end_seconds": 95.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "okay, raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Your ankle reflexes are absent and the strength in both legs is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.05,
      "end_seconds": 124.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "you can relax now right and what about bladder problems fever or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.41,
      "end_seconds": 128.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "no, you know, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.54,
      "end_seconds": 131.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "is your urine normal no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.45,
      "end_seconds": 136.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.11,
      "end_seconds": 140.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Right, is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.43,
      "end_seconds": 143.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.0,
      "end_seconds": 155.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "okay, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.7,
      "end_seconds": 158.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.92,
      "end_seconds": 161.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.84,
      "end_seconds": 173.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.18,
      "text": "well, I have high blood pressure. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.34,
      "end_seconds": 179.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.77,
      "end_seconds": 202.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.04,
      "end_seconds": 206.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "not to my knowledge no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.83,
      "end_seconds": 211.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.89,
      "end_seconds": 224.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I retired from the post office two years ago. No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.43,
      "end_seconds": 229.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.95,
      "end_seconds": 235.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Just a cataract operation in my left eye about a year ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.47,
      "end_seconds": 246.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.66,
      "end_seconds": 259.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "It's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. Valsartan. I take it 80 milligrams, once a day. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.0,
      "end_seconds": 280.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Alright, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.53,
      "end_seconds": 283.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.64,
      "end_seconds": 295.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at possible Guillain-Barre syndrome or a spinal cord problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.7,
      "end_seconds": 301.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.82,
      "end_seconds": 316.29,
      "duration_seconds": 13.47,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible Guillain-Barre syndrome do well once it's treated properly i want a breathing test done, that's for possible GBS"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 316.84,
      "end_seconds": 320.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.18,
      "end_seconds": 324.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "okay, I'll be there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.25,
      "end_seconds": 339.65,
      "duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "text": "You must be admitted today for monitoring of your breathing. We'll refer you to the neurology team. Book a review straight away. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.31,
      "end_seconds": 343.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Good thanks I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
